== Notes ==
* The Forsaken can be instantly killed with {{I|Vade Retro}} if it is at 50% health or below.

== Trivia ==
* It is the posthumous version of {{E|The Haunt}}.
* When The Forsaken disappears, it covers its eyesockets with its arm-like bones. This is most likely a reference to [[Wikipedia:Boo (character)|Boos]] from the ''Mario'' franchise.
* The Forsaken appears to be The Haunt without its ghostly exterior.
* During the versus screen, the Forsaken's Bony-spawning sound can be heard.
** The Forsaken is one of {{Dlc|nr}}seven/{{Dlc|r}}five bosses that can be heard during the versus screen, the other {{Dlc|nr}}six/{{Dlc|r}}four being {{e|The Stain}}, {{e|Big Horn}}, {{e|Mom}}, {{Dlc|nr}} {{e|Mom's Heart}}, {{Dlc|nr}}{{e|It Lives!}}, and {{e|Mother}}.
* {{dlc+|a+}} The Forsaken can be found in {{s|The Void}}, even before being unlocked.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc|r}} The Forsaken has an alternative resurrected variation known as {{e|The Heretic}}.

